  - m_Id: 350670597500928
    m_Localized: 'Stay 10 meters away! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 355203180507136
    m_Localized: '<b>HOVERING</b>

      Position yourself at eye level with the
      pilot, 5/10 m away from him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 355540008284160
    m_Localized: '<b>FLIGHT TRANSITION</b>

      Position yourself at a height of
      20m to 5m away from the aircraft.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 356272560254976
    m_Localized: '<b>FLIGHT TRANSITION</b>

      Move away by doing an S in slow
      flight

      (follow the guide)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358176224817152
    m_Localized: '<b>FLIGHT TRANSITION</b>

      Return along same patrh doing an
      S in slow flight

      (follow the guide)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358747015065600
    m_Localized: '<b>ASCENT & DESCENT</b>

      Move away, climbing up to 40m'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 358966431690752
    m_Localized: '<b>ASCENT & DESCENT</b>

      Descent 20 meters and maintain level
      flight until reaching the pilot'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 359773575163904
    m_Localized: '<b>FLIGHT SPEED CONTROL</b>

      Place at 30 meters'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 359788452360192
    m_Localized: '<b>FLIGHT SPEED CONTROL</b>

      Make the rectangle without exceeding
      18 km/h'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 360448434483200
    m_Localized: '<b>TAKEOFF & LANDING</b>

      Take off 50 meters'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 360466671316992
    m_Localized: '<b>TAKEOFF & LANDING</b>

      Land in the emergency zone ( H
      )'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361068692353024
    m_Localized: '<b>ENGINE FAILURE SIMULATION</b>

      Take off 50 meters above
      the emergency zone'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361092088180736
    m_Localized: '<b>ENGINE FAILURE SIMULATION</b>

      Spiral descent with speed
      and "hard" takeover'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361707199639552
    m_Localized: '<b>COMMUNICATION FAILURE SIMULATION</b>

      Ascend 50 meters
      and head toward the forest ahead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361772303626240
    m_Localized: 'SIGNAL LOSS! RUN RTH

      (press R)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 362532777078784
    m_Localized: "\r<b>SITUATION MANAGEMENT I</b>\nTake off and ascent 50m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 362602515771392
    m_Localized: '<b>SITUATION MANAGEMENT I</b>

      Stay 10 meters away from the
      UAS until the timer expires'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 362627857756160
    m_Localized: '<b>SITUATION MANAGEMENT II</b>

      Take off and ascent 50m'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364281436942336
    m_Localized: '<b>SITUATION MANAGEMENT I</b>

      Land in the emergency zone
      ( H )'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364045729640448
    m_Localized: '<b>SITUATION MANAGEMENT II</b>

      Stay 10 meters away from
      the UAS until the timer expires'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 364058652291072
    m_Localized: '<b>SITUATION MANAGEMENT II</b>

      Land in the emergency zone
      ( H )'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
