  - m_Id: 369426178617344
    m_Localized: Place yourself on top of the first cone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 369575772663808
    m_Localized: Head for the second cone forward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1516271344922624
    m_Localized: Laterally, head to the next cone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1516637788680192
    m_Localized: Turn towards the cone and go towards it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1518057824825344
    m_Localized: Finally, toward back to the next cone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1518353359679488
    m_Localized: Finally, rotate and head towards the last cone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
